nemies, all in order to reach the most coveted of all fortunes—One Piece.\\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\",\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"b1Uzg4F55kM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"s3c7IHsXMt0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"5UAYDDsD_F8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\"}],\"relations\":[{\"id\":167404,\"type\":\"ANIME\",\"title\":\"MONSTERS: 103 Mercies Dragon Damnation\",\"format\":\"ONA\",\"status\":\"FINISHED\",\"seasonYear\":2024}],\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Luffy Monkey\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/b40-MNypXsxSRb1R.png\",\"voiceActor\":\"Mayumi Tanaka\"},{\"name\":\"Robin Nico\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/b61-ywXUyyocEEqt.png\",\"voiceActor\":\"Yuriko Yamaguchi\"},{\"name\":\"Zoro Roronoa\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/b62-S7oAeA9WInjV.png\",\"voiceActor\":\"Kazuya Nakai\"},{\"name\":\"Franky\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/n64-ChX6ZzHHjXqA.png\",\"voiceActor\":\"Kazuki Yao\"},{\"name\":\"Sanji\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/b305-6lisPmHtCnLT.png\",\"voiceActor\":\"Hiroaki Hirata\"},{\"name\":\"Chopper Tony Tony\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/b309-H64NhbJ2ywIQ.jpg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Ikue Ootani\"},{\"name\":\"Nami\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/b723-vp5hPptgnNEC.png\",\"voiceActor\":\"Akemi Okamura\"},{\"name\":\"Usopp\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/b724-GFGgI9AJQkfy.jpg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Kappei Yamaguchi\"},{\"name\":\"Brook\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/b5627-av8oD3zhKvDl.png\",\"voiceActor\":\"Choo\"},{\"name\":\"Jinbe\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"imag